---
import Information from '../layouts/Information.astro';
import OperatorContact from '../components/OperatorContact.astro';
import { DISCLAIMER_HEADING, DISCLAIMER_TEXT } from '../lib/legal';
---

<Information
  title="Legal disclaimer"
  description="The nature of this satirical aggregator, third-party rights and content removal."
>
  <section class="site-disclaimer" aria-labelledby="disclaimer-heading">
    <h2 id="disclaimer-heading">{DISCLAIMER_HEADING}</h2>
    <p>{DISCLAIMER_TEXT}</p>
  </section>
  <section aria-labelledby="nature">
    <h2 id="nature">1. Nature of the Website</h2>
    <p>
      We Are All Gonna Die aggregates third-party material, memes and commentary
      for satire and entertainment. It is not a news organization or an
      authoritative source of factual information.
    </p>
  </section>
  <section aria-labelledby="accuracy">
    <h2 id="accuracy">2. Satire and Accuracy</h2>
    <p>
      The Doom Monitor's status messages and commentary are satirical. Linked
      publications may describe real events; their presence here does not verify
      their accuracy. Follow source links and consult reliable original sources
      to distinguish reported events from our satirical presentation.
    </p>
  </section>
  <section aria-labelledby="third-party">
    <h2 id="third-party">3. Third-Party Content</h2>
    <p>
      External publishers remain responsible for their own statements. Their
      websites and embedded content are subject to their own terms and privacy
      practices. Inclusion does not imply affiliation with or endorsement by a
      source. The operator reviews concerns about material presented here and
      may remove it when appropriate.
    </p>
  </section>
  <section aria-labelledby="rights">
    <h2 id="rights">4. Intellectual Property</h2>
    <p>
      Third-party rights remain with their owners. Attribution, source links and
      embeds do not grant unrestricted reuse rights. Any reuse requires its own
      rights assessment. Copyright concerns can be submitted through the contact
      below.
    </p>
  </section>
  <section aria-labelledby="independence">
    <h2 id="independence">5. Editorial Independence</h2>
    <p>
      Selection and satirical commentary reflect this website's editorial
      choices. Sources do not control those choices merely because their content
      appears here. Original reporting and this site's commentary should be read
      separately.
    </p>
  </section>
  <section aria-labelledby="removal">
    <h2 id="removal">6. Content Removal</h2>
    <p>
      Email the contact below with the affected publication link (or its title
      and original source URL), your concern, supporting information and a reply
      address. For copyright complaints, identify the work and explain your
      ownership or authority to act.
    </p>
    <p>
      The operator will review requests and may hide a publication when
      appropriate. A private record of the complaint and action may be retained
      to manage the request. No guaranteed response deadline is promised.
    </p>
  </section>
  <section aria-labelledby="contact">
    <h2 id="contact">7. Contact</h2>
    <OperatorContact />
    <p>
      See the <a href="/privacy">privacy information</a> for details about media
      requests and privacy questions.
    </p>
  </section>
</Information>
